        "thought_text": "Parse the input molecule string and the count $k$ to calculate the total inventory of each atom type available. Then, parse the output molecule string to determine the atom requirements per single output molecule. Finally, divide the total available atoms by the required atoms for each type and take the floor of the minimum ratio to find the maximum number of output molecules.",
